{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04712","headline":"右侍郎集贤院学士徐公挽词二首 二 · 张说","name":"右侍郎集贤院学士徐公挽词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叹息书林友，才华天下选。\n并赋三阳宫，集诗集贤殿。\n具物衣如在，咄嗟长不见。\n既哀薤露词，岂忘平生眷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}